    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87073" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδοκέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seem good, be resolved beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ προδόξαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.3563
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Thisbe</span>):—mostly in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ προὐδέδοκτο αὐτοῖς</span>”
				<i>had been before determined,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ προδεδογμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.40
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτά μοι προὐδέδοκτο</span>
			this <i>was</i> my <i>former opinion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				88d
			</span></i>.</div>
